// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2254053175" "You think you're the only gang in town?  You thought WRONG!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3292735621" "Hellions will not be ignored!  Dockside is ours!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P672763361" "I hope this hurts!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P135965251" "Let's torch them!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1037898472" "Mess with the Hellions and you get some heat!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1676046425" "I got a good view from here.  Can see most of Oil Spill.  We're clear."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P104977980" "Things are good here.  How's it on your end?"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1671879051" "If anyone gets in our way, we know what to do."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1350258870" "A few stragglers.  No one's engaged us yet."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1948861980" "I'm out.  Gotta take care of this!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1631243044" "Gotta go.  A punk just got too close."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P580196919" "Fire.  It's a beautiful thing."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3687707014" "Man, I love Oil Spill.  So many slicks, so little time."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2544829745" "That's art, man.  Art."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4147764286" "It lights AND it's slippery.  Does it get any better than that?"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2947470444" "Oil Spill is our turf!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_OILBLAZE_LIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P458520301" "Where did that torch go?  I got a target."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3350414271" "This bat says I win."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P462604709" "This bat says you shoulda moved on."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P759750037" "Your brain is my home run, pal!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P846300963" "You couldn't stay in your own area.  Had to move into our space.  Big mistake."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3887364428" "You want some of this?  Come and get it!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1678141996" "Oh yeah?  Feel the love, punk!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2969193461" "I'll cut you!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2237867524" "Your blood on this knife will be sweet!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P316244668" "Oh yeah?  You think so?  How about some of THIS!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P483132102" "You can't dodge forever, pal!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2180685721" "This knife's for you!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P507497044" "Welcome to my blade, victim."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1578340342" "Let my knife point you the way to the morgue!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1504288443" "Time to work my butchering skills!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1754983483" "Oh good.  Fresh meat!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1078994567" "Hellions will RULE Dockside!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1583354470" "Be glad I don't have a knife.  You'd be dead by now."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2853495545" "Oh.  You want some of this?  Come and get it!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3659455028" "Come get some, punk!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P390415175" "Hellions will RULE you!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2452852014" "Gentle doesn't work.  You gotta pound on it."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P327910948" "Be cool.  Professional at work here."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2536098351" "This is an art, man.  Don't rush the master."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P613246151" "When in doubt, use a hammer."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P91087795" "Move the light a bit, I can't see."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3178021374" "This better be worth it.  Last time we broke in, all we found was Synapse dolls."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1075750693" "Good grief, could you work any slower?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P697683031" "Put your back into it, man.  My sister is stronger than you."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2061960212" "Sheesh.  What is that door made of?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3086310985" "Are you sure you're hitting it right?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P403687816" "Didn't we break into this place last week?  I say we try down the block."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P101514929" "You gotta finesse it.  You'll never get in that way."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P652980450" "Forget the door, we got company!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P597846876" "Aw jeez.  I thought you had it.  Now we gotta take care of this interruption."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2539648584" "What?  You couldn't just go bug someone else?  Had to horn in on our action?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1644131797" "I really don't like you very much.  For that you will pay dearly."

// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1035450969" "Yeah, so we got in this big fight and she kicked me out.  Whatever."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1477976240" "I think Hellions are gonna be BIG in this town."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1786660643" "Hey, you wanna go to Oil Slick later and light some Molotovs?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2717222433" "Were you standing in the oil when you lit the torch?  Cool!  I gotta try that."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1781762880" "Wanna go rough up some gamblers at the arena?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2899315092" "I pretty much stay away from Fort Hades.  That place gives me the creeps."

// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3610098300" "Interrupt much?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1682449409" "I don't think I invited you into this conversation."
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769471854" "Problems?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1569296221" "You just interrupted a private conversation!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1197439175" "Wow, I am on a ROLL here."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3240303361" "We should start playing for money.  I'm winning by a landslide!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1288029014" "I LOVE this game!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1247969040" "Yes!  Another win!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4107813154" "Hey, get your own dice!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P948763143" "This is a TWO-player game."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1313175226" "Oh, you are NOT stepping in to my action."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3837665452" "Bad move."

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_WINNER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4213246058" "Nice costume."

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3141540765" "You know losing over and over is no fun for me, right?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2434133273" "Let's go play cards.  This game sucks."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3343437787" "Did you load those dice again?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3371184383" "Jeez!  I can't win!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P628366042" "What is YOUR problem?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1760658109" "Losing put me in a foul mood.  Beating you up will improve it."
// OAKES_GENERIC_DICE_LOSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P142216616" "Problem?"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3564521305" "I do this all the time.  You'd think I'd be faster at it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2501202837" "You know, I keep telling you.  Berating me does not help."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4274389205" "Sure, pressuring me helps.  Did you want to get in sometime tonight?  Or later this month?  Shut it!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P808888151" "I just need to finesse it a little.  Give me a second."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P133286707" "Shut it!  I don't see you doing anything but standing around and whining."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3769237190" "Oh, you think you can do better?"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P76151887" "Age spot number 47.  Age spot number 48..."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P653140303" "I think day AND night just went by."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P49365894" "You must know someone important because you're really not very good at this."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1514354512" "Ohhkay...this is taking a long time."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1297199536" "If you don't get that lock in four more minutes, I'm going to go get something to eat."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2278969830" "Seriously, have you ever considered a job in demolition?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2888712006" "Finesse?  Is that what they call brute force now?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4153339430" "Wow, you really are bad at this."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3654620984" "Why don't we just break a window?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2917285211" "Why don't we just find a door that's unlocked?"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2227764099" "You might want to use those finesse skills of yours on the meat coming this way."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2112956413" "I hope you're better at fighting than you are lock picking!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3728000160" "Uh...pal?  Psst.  Time to fight."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P72379439" "Time's up!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER2_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1672255828" "You ain't seen nothin', pal."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER2_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3482802519" "You gonna give us problems?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER2_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3408046072" "We just forgot our keys, pal. Nothin's going on here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BREAKIN_WATCHER2_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3269206154" "They went that way! Over there!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3774587173" "Yes!  Burn, baby, burn!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1494806193" "This is better than standing in flaming oil slicks!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2063508175" "Let's go inside!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2503353441" "Fire is a beautiful thing."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2033954511" "You are a genius!  If we're really lucky maybe we'll get a back draft!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1242149829" "Whoa!  Someone coming to spoil the party."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P935551632" "Let's throw 'em in the flames!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3469471475" "Don't even think about messing with that blaze!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3912413811" "Oh, you're going down!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1349660775" "Grab a hero, pal, we'll have a barbeque."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3652447068" "There ain't no such thing as a burn ban."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BURNINGBUILDING_CHEER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P747712584" "You gonna give us trouble?"

// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1227082227" "Do you think they have ANY idea what they're in for?  I see these guys coming off the copters day and night."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3879460199" "Hey, what say we go burn down a building later?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4219659412" "I feel like beating someone up.  You ever get that feeling?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4231125855" "Let's go throw rocks at some Infected.  They don't move so fast."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3938573349" "Come out to the coast, we'll get together, have a few laughs."

// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1667666583" "It's like a nightmare isn't it?  Just keeps getting worse and worse!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P729679617" "I'm going to teach you about fire!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P949393491" "I've got a match with your name on it!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P259731679" "Who do you think you are?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1006009602" "You're nothing here!  Nothing!  Let me pound the point home!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3721520927" "This is the best they could do for chosen ones?  My grandmother is more evil than this chunk of meat."

// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3457302270" "We didn't start the fire!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3041651342" "Spare a light?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2729142178" "You're nothing here! This is our turf!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LEDGE_HECKLER2_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1517286222" "Go pound a hero."

// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2292205162" "This is so awesome.  We're Hellion girlfriends!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P21298543" "Do you think anyone can see us with these Hellions guys?  I bet they're so jealous!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3464380310" "Our guys are so powerful, aren't they?  I love being a Hellion's girlfriend!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2986405584" "My guy is a lieutenant, which is yours?"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3468204730" "Tara is going to be so jealous.  She's just dating a drummer."
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046691431" "My mom, like, said I wouldn't do anything with my life.  She was soooo wrong."
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2636425550" "I'm serious.  Those Skulls girls think they are so hot, but they are so NOT."
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2973263554" "So I think we should totally tell our guys that rhinestones on their jackets would really spruce them up!"

// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3855098106" "You guys didn't say anything about live fire!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P714393198" "ACK!  Run!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3107460476" "They're shooting!  Run!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P527746194" "This is SO not the way I thought it was going to be!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3891592626" "Love you, honey, see you at Blackbeard's later!"
// OAKES_GENERIC_NPCWANNABE_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2359109092" "I'm breaking up with you!  You're too high maintenance!"

